<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post9157757835389134128..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: What&#39;s So &quot;Sinister&quot; About &quot;Liberty, Prosperity, and Peace&quot;?</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>20</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4612722772848611721</id><published>2007-11-15T06:49:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-15T06:49:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>straightarrow -- I&#39;m interested! Drop me a note at...</title><content type='html'>straightarrow -- I&#39;m interested! Drop me a note at WNGrigg [at] msn dot com.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4612722772848611721'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4612722772848611721'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1195134540000#c4612722772848611721' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 15, 2007 at 6:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-755754285094789358</id><published>2007-11-14T23:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-14T23:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Griggs, I would be receptive to your  question...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Griggs, I would be receptive to your  question regarding my previous comment.  Unless, of course, you know the answer.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/755754285094789358'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/755754285094789358'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1195109520000#c755754285094789358' title=''/><author><name>straightarrow</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2007 at 11:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4354450924180098703</id><published>2007-11-14T23:49:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-14T23:49:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>-I ask this question, what is the only thing these...</title><content type='html'>-I ask this question, what is the only thing these five men had in common other than meeting violence and being male?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;John F. Kennedy, Abraham Lincoln, Robert F. Kennedy, George Wallace, and Martin Luther King. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There is ONLY  one thing common to all of them, other than the exceptions stated above. Does anybody besides me know what it is?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;If interested, but unable to answer,I will tell you. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Let me know.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4354450924180098703'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4354450924180098703'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1195109340000#c4354450924180098703' title=''/><author><name>straightarrow</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2007 at 11:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4086379997083408317</id><published>2007-11-13T13:23:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-13T13:23:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It&#39;s become clear over the years that the official...</title><content type='html'>It&#39;s become clear over the years that the official story of the JFK assassination was a well-constructed fabrication, and yet those who proffer this view publically are considered nutjobs by their fellow plebs. Why in the world would anyone think they can&#39;t bump off RP without bringing the public out of its stupor? Where&#39;s the evidence that the people will &lt;I&gt;finally&lt;/I&gt; awaken?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4086379997083408317'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4086379997083408317'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194985380000#c4086379997083408317' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 13, 2007 at 1:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2641901572030549382</id><published>2007-11-11T18:04:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-11T18:04:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>According to the Blog Readability Test, your blog&#39;...</title><content type='html'>According to the Blog Readability Test, your blog&#39;s reading level is College (postgrad).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.criticsrant.com/bb/reading_level.aspx</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2641901572030549382'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2641901572030549382'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194829440000#c2641901572030549382' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 11, 2007 at 6:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3289044244629441709</id><published>2007-11-11T17:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-11T17:02:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Long ago, when I minored in political science, &quot;Re...</title><content type='html'>Long ago, when I minored in political science, &quot;Report From Iron Mountain&quot; was required reading in one of my classes. Apparently, perpetual war has been considered a necessity for some time, perhaps for several decades or more. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I considered the arguments presented in the book to be slick sophistry. Needless to say, I paid the price for my doubts and written opinions by receiving the instructor&#39;s utter contempt and a mediocre grade in spite of otherwise excellent performance. Most learned early on that one &quot;goes along to get along&quot; as far as (to use a 60&#39;s term) &quot;the system&quot; is concerned.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Even now, as the welfare/warfare state known as America plummets down the slippery slope to ruin, I doubt if the perpetual-war-is-good crowd will see the light. Since many in the political segment of that camp are prepaid military-industrial whores anyway, it probably wouldn&#39;t make much difference even if they did. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thankfully, Dr. Paul has never bought into the myth. He appears to be the only glimmer of hope on the dark horizon.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3289044244629441709'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3289044244629441709'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194825720000#c3289044244629441709' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 11, 2007 at 5:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3809342511737115352</id><published>2007-11-10T22:03:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-10T22:03:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It is unfortunate, but I would not be surprised if...</title><content type='html'>It is unfortunate, but I would not be surprised if something bad happened to him. There is a lot of blood/tax money that powerful people will not want to give up. If his campaign keeps up this success, he should probably eat only eat meals that he or his loved ones prepare. Remember what Putin did to that Russian?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3809342511737115352'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3809342511737115352'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194757380000#c3809342511737115352' title=''/><author><name>Zachary</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05334525584242029389</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-995279443"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 10, 2007 at 10:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2280393755178113040</id><published>2007-11-10T17:21:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-10T17:21:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>My first question for the person you mentioned at ...</title><content type='html'>My first question for the person you mentioned at the beginning is &quot;Which competing GOP candidate are you working for?&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2280393755178113040'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2280393755178113040'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194740460000#c2280393755178113040' title=''/><author><name>Al Newberry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12702350396853727859</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2027341530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 10, 2007 at 5:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3826364121050660965</id><published>2007-11-10T13:50:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-10T13:50:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, Outstanding summation.  A friend from Indian...</title><content type='html'>Will, Outstanding summation.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A friend from Indianapolis.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3826364121050660965'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3826364121050660965'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194727800000#c3826364121050660965' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 10, 2007 at 1:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3492368234426323966</id><published>2007-11-10T09:58:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-10T09:58:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The prescient Mister Spock stated:&quot;However, I thin...</title><content type='html'>The prescient Mister Spock stated:&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;However, I think there&#39;s a pretty good chance that assassinating him would make him a martyr, and I&#39;m sure the puppet masters have considered that as well.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Yes, I&#39;m sure they have; however, in this age, I don&#39;t think they have any disinclination whatsoever to &quot;flush&quot; Dr. Paul, especially if it&#39;s their last resort to rid themselves of this pesky &quot;nativist/populist&quot; who dares to upset their economic and political plans for the US and the world. &lt;BR/&gt;I can hear them saying: &lt;BR/&gt;&quot; Yeah, go ahead. Let them have their martyr. Eventually, they&#39;ll get over it, and we&#39;ll march on toward total government, world government.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;               &lt;BR/&gt;             -Boy Gilligan</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3492368234426323966'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3492368234426323966'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194713880000#c3492368234426323966' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 10, 2007 at 9:58 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4043755184138050937</id><published>2007-11-10T00:57:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-10T00:57:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>P.S. &quot;People Gotta Be Free&quot; is a great song and a ...</title><content type='html'>P.S. &quot;People Gotta Be Free&quot; is a great song and a good choice, but I&#39;m still going with what I posted some time back on the Right Source website: Tom Petty&#39;s &quot;I Won&#39;t Back Down.&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4043755184138050937'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4043755184138050937'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194681420000#c4043755184138050937' title=''/><author><name>Mister Spock</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04790678390017800846</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1307178746"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 10, 2007 at 12:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3266193704408728393</id><published>2007-11-10T00:53:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-10T00:53:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will -There is no question that as the Ron Paul ju...</title><content type='html'>Will -&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There is no question that as the Ron Paul juggernaut picks up speed that Dr. Paul will have legitimate reason  to fear for his life. However, I think there&#39;s a pretty good chance that assassinating him would make him a martyr, and I&#39;m sure the puppet masters have considered that as well. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Not long ago I was reading through some of the comments posted about Ron Paul videos at youtube, and I ran across this:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;As a Brit, I would like to state in my opinion Ron Paul is the President America [and rest of the world] Needs.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;But lets imagine for one minute,that you could actually reverse the lobotomy the American Media preformed on the American electorate.And coupling that with the improbability that he even manages to beat the rigged US voting system.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Sadly he will be lucky to see the year out, as the Industrial Military Complex will do a JFK on him.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That Limey has some good insight. It would not be too early to be praying for Dr. Paul&#39;s safety.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3266193704408728393'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3266193704408728393'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194681180000#c3266193704408728393' title=''/><author><name>Mister Spock</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04790678390017800846</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1307178746"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 10, 2007 at 12:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2086185037543703298</id><published>2007-11-09T21:53:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T21:53:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Are we tuned in to the extraordinary event being p...</title><content type='html'>Are we tuned in to the extraordinary event being planned to commemorate the upcoming anniversary of the Boston Tea Party, on Dec. 16?&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.teaparty07.com</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2086185037543703298'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2086185037543703298'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194670380000#c2086185037543703298' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 9:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6277107804543021881</id><published>2007-11-09T18:20:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T18:20:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I don&#39;t know if the Ron Paul “Love Revolution” has...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;I don&#39;t know if the Ron Paul “Love Revolution” has an unofficial anthem, but the 1968 classic “People Gotta Be Free” by the Rascals would be a good choice. &lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;How about &quot;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.stlyrics.com/songs/b/belindacarlisle468/loverevolution21291.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Love Revolution&lt;/A&gt;&quot; by Belinda Carlisle?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/6277107804543021881'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/6277107804543021881'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194657600000#c6277107804543021881' title=''/><author><name>Glaivester</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16867323638154972101</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='30' src='http://photos9.flickr.com/14627600_a4c2da82b2_t.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1146762353"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 6:20 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3003695962141150799</id><published>2007-11-09T16:36:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T16:36:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Wonderful piece (hmmm, sounds like wonderful peace...</title><content type='html'>Wonderful piece (hmmm, sounds like wonderful peace)&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I love the Rascal&#39;s song. It&#39;s a long time favorite.&lt;BR/&gt;I especially love the admonition that we&#39;ve gotta solve it &#39;individually&#39;. People forget that the 60&#39;s scene was a libertarian scene until it was co-opted by the statists</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3003695962141150799'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/3003695962141150799'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194651360000#c3003695962141150799' title=''/><author><name>Capn Mike</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 4:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1898004752449847585</id><published>2007-11-09T13:30:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T13:30:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>If the Ron Paul Movement reaches critical mass, Dr...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;If the Ron Paul Movement reaches critical mass, Dr. Paul might find himself in mortal peril.&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Yep, in fact when I first noticed some of the positive attention (from the commoners) that Ron Paul was attracting, similar thoughts came immediately to mind.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I wrote &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/ron-paul-this-is-man-take-notes.html#c6420660012100118899&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;this&lt;/A&gt; in your &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/ron-paul-this-is-man-take-notes.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt; Ron Paul: This Is A Man. Take Notes.&lt;/A&gt; comment thread.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;However, I &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.haloscan.com/comments/voxday/6886825815576428613/#1942935&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;believe&lt;/A&gt; there&#39;s also some truth to those who claim opposition to the Iraq War is the only real unifying glue that explains much of the trans-political support of Dr. Paul, NOT real principle or an earnest belief in small government.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Mr. Roth likewise reminds me why I harbor some contempt for the Manhattan set, or any urban big city set for that matter. They are almost to a person rabid State worshippers of one form or another. And like any other Trotskyite socialists, they think themselves superior in all areas and absolutely despise the middle-class. The one and only societal sect that can manage to temper or even, at times, restrain their hellish ambitions.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/1898004752449847585'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/1898004752449847585'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194640200000#c1898004752449847585' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 1:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4958258310151202869</id><published>2007-11-09T10:44:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T10:44:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>WOW. Great article!You rock, sir.</title><content type='html'>WOW. Great article!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;You rock, sir.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4958258310151202869'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/4958258310151202869'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194630240000#c4958258310151202869' title=''/><author><name>Rich</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11487457932921643164</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1372709716"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 10:44 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2803903975383241558</id><published>2007-11-09T10:19:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T10:19:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>AT least the Canadians tell it like it is.  About ...</title><content type='html'>AT least the Canadians tell it like it is.  About 4 years ago I toured the capitol building of British Columbia in Victoria.  One the wall there is inscribed the long list of names of the BCers who died in WW 1.    They died for &quot;The glory of the Empire&quot;, it says.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2803903975383241558'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2803903975383241558'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194628740000#c2803903975383241558' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 10:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2380103256876108809</id><published>2007-11-09T09:32:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T09:32:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;Setting the realm at rest&quot; through foreign wars: ...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;&quot;Setting the realm at rest&quot; through foreign wars: How many of the honored dead whose remains are interred at Arlington really died on behalf of freedom -- rather than for the greater glory of the State?&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The answer is &quot;zero.&quot;  Since Arlington National Cemetery wasn&#39;t established until 1864, in the thick of the War to Prevent Southern Independence, it&#39;s first interments were the casualties of that war.  Specifically, the dead were those combatants fighting on behalf of an out-of-control federal government in the iron grip of a tyrant who was waging an illegal war against the very citizens he had sworn an oath to defend.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Subsequent wars that contributed to the population of this oversized dormitory of the dead were no different.  In fact, most if not all were worse, wars of aggression against foreign nations that either had done nothing to endanger the United States or had been deliberately provoked into attacking it in order to defend themselves and their survival.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2380103256876108809'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2380103256876108809'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194625920000#c2380103256876108809' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 9:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2048314712076694253</id><published>2007-11-09T09:14:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-09T09:14:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>One reason I came to loathe politics is the terrib...</title><content type='html'>One reason I came to loathe politics is the terrible bad faith endemic to the system.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Yes of course Ron Paul draws this kind of support.  But let&#39;s compare it to mainstream support for other candidates: an irrational arrogant historically blind ignorant contempt for the millions of people the united states has murdered and impoverished in the middle east over the last decades, and a pig-headed desire to keep piling it on in the face of the almost certain economic calamity it is going to bring on us.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Wherever you stand, you have bad company.  Ron Paul&#39;s problem supporters are just going to keep being who they are, and they won&#39;t gain political power, no matter who wins.  They are essentially irrelevant, except as a bad faith tool for a lot of people incapable of considering their own serious evil inclinations.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2048314712076694253'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9157757835389134128/comments/default/2048314712076694253'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html?showComment=1194624840000#c2048314712076694253' title=''/><author><name>thesilentcritic</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/whats-so-sinister-about-liberty.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9157757835389134128' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9157757835389134128' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2007 at 9:14 AM"/></entry></feed>